OL,3,AGas bill standing charges to be
OL,4,Ascrapped for millions, chancellor says
OL,5,Aahead of Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FStanding charges are to be scrapped
OL,8,Ffrom household gas bills for millions,
OL,9,Fsays Chancellor John Healey, hours
OL,10,Fbefore he delivers his first Budget
OL,12,FThe move - due to take effect next year
OL,13,F"or as soon as possible" - will save
OL,14,F60% of households an average of #45 per
OL,15,Fyear, according to the Treasury
OL,17,FHealey is due to set out the
OL,18,Fgovernment's tax and spending plans, in
OL,19,Ffull, at 12:30 GMT - here's how the day
OL,20,Fwill unfold
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
