OL,3,ANorway and Finland leaders hold rare
OL,4,Acall with Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leaders of Finland and Norway have
OL,7,Fheld a joint call with Vladimir Putin -
OL,8,Frare contact between the Russian
OL,9,Fpresident and European leaders.
OL,11,FFinland's President Alexander Stubb and
OL,12,FNorwegian Prime Minister Jonas Gahr
OL,13,FStC8re said the aim of the call had
OL,14,Fbeen to "convey messages directly
OL,15,Fregarding future negotiations" towards
OL,16,Fpeace. An end to the conflict in
OL,17,FUkraine "will not be achieved through
OL,18,Fsilence," Stubb said.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
