OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANorway and Finland leaders hold rare
OL,4,Acall with Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeither side suggested the needle had
OL,7,Fbeen moved on ending the war, which
OL,8,Fbegan when Russia launched its
OL,9,Ffull-scale invasion of Ukraine in 2022.
OL,11,FAlthough the Finnish leader said the
OL,12,Fconversation with Putin had been "frank
OL,13,Fand substantive," StC8re added that
OL,14,Fthere were "big differences in views"
OL,15,Fwith Putin.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
