OL,3,ACeasefire extended across Ukraine's
OL,4,AKherson region, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS First Lady Melania Trump, who helped
OL,7,Fbroker the ceasefire along with Pope
OL,8,FLeo XIV, said on Tuesday that the area
OL,9,Finvolved had been expanded to provide
OL,10,F"safe passage" for humanitarian
OL,11,Fconvoys.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
